covalence (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Messages: reactions shown on the quoted message, merged when reported
    twice, adding up per emoji; hover bar to react, copy or delete.
  * One-time SMS codes copied from the notification; browser fill-in for
    Chrome, Chromium, Edge and Firefox (alpha).
  * "Read in full" for long unread messages, on request or always.
  * Sync button; sounds for messages, notifications and calls.
  * Update checker (GitHub releases) and installer in Settings.
  * Alpha features: extended history, mark read, notification actions,
    favourites.
  * "What's new" window after an update.

 -- Melvin Couwez <301110918+melvincouwez-alt@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 23:30:00 +0200

covalence (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First public alpha release.
  * Renamed from Tandem to Covalence; covalenced moves the settings, cache,
    keyring key, user units and old launchers of a Tandem install on its
    first start.
  * Works on elementary OS 8 and 9: calls need PipeWire 1.4 or later and are
    shown as unavailable otherwise; rclone is downloaded on request when the
    system copy is missing or too old.

 -- Melvin Couwez <301110918+melvincouwez-alt@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 27 Sep 2026 20:00:00 +0200
